<<effects>>

<<set $ward_unlocked to true>>
<<run getChildrenAt("alex_cottage").forEach(child => {
	const pregnancy = getPregnancyOf(child);
	if (pregnancy.donor === "Alex" || pregnancy.carrier === "Alex") child.development.location = "home";
})>>

Alex turns to you. "I hate to say this, but this... offer might be a good thing, for the <<pluralise $alexBabiesCount "kid">> at least. I don't like the price, or losing <<pluralise $alexBabiesCount "it">>, but it will give us more time to prepare a room. It's only temporary, right?" You nod.
<br><br>

"Okay," Alex says, returning <<his>> attention to Bailey again.
<br><br>

<<He>> gives one last long hug to <<his>> <<pluralise $alexBabiesCount "child">> before handing <<pluralise $alexBabiesCount "it">> to Bailey.
<br><br>

"I'm glad we could reach an agreement. Now, if you'll excuse me..." Bailey says as <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> leaves.
<br><br>

Alex stands there, helplessly watching <<his>> <<pluralise $alexBabiesCount "child">> being taken away, stone-faced and silent.
<br>

Tears roll down <<his>> face, but <<he>> does <<his>> best to keep up <<his>> stoic façade for your sake.
<br><br>

<<link [[Comfort <<him>>|Farm Alex Birth 11]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Let it go|Farm Alex Birth 11]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>

