<br><br>

<<pluralise $pcBabyCount "It sits" "They sit">> in your arms, eyes shut, <<pluralise $pcBabyCount "chest">> rising and falling with gentle breaths. You hold your <<pluralise $pcBabyCount "baby">> close to your chest.
