"I've run all the tests," Harper says. "There's not a single health problem. Have you two thought of <<pluralise $pcBabyCount "a name" "their names">>?"
<br><br>

"Well," Alex says. "You did all the hard work, you should name <<if $pcBabyCount is 1>><<if getLabouringLitter("pc")[0].gender is "m">>him<<else>>her<</if>><<else>>them<</if>>."
