:: Farm Alex Orphanage Trip 3
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>>

<<run getChildrenAt("home").forEach(child => {
	const pregnancy = getPregnancyOf(child);
	if (pregnancy.donor === "Alex" || pregnancy.carrier === "Alex") child.development.location = "alex_cottage";
})>>

<<person1>><<His>> <<person3>><<father>> drives to the farm, occasionally looking at <<his>> <<if childrenCountBetweenParents("pc","Alex") is 1>>grandchild<<else>>grandchildren<</if>> and smiling.
<br><br>

It's not a long trip, and you soon arrive at the farm.
<br><br>

Alex helps you leave the vehicle and take your <<if childrenCountBetweenParents("pc","Alex") is 1>>child<<else>>children<</if>> to the cottage's nursery.
<br><br>

Alex's <<father>> turns to Alex. "I need to get back to work now, but listen, I'm proud of you, you're making this place look like a home," <<he>> says as <<he>> drives away.<<person1>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Cottage]]>><</link>>

:: Farm Cottage Baby Request
<<effects>>

<<set C.npc.Alex.pregnancy.pills to "fertility">>
<<set C.npc.Alex.pregnancyAvoidance to 0>>
<<set $NPCList[0].pregnancyAvoidance to 0>>

"있잖아." 당신이 <<him>>에게 더 가까이 다가가며 말한다. "<<if childrenCountBetweenParents("pc","Alex") lte 0 or childrenCountBetweenParents("Alex","pc") lte 0>>아기<<else>>다른 아기<</if>> 하나 더 갖자."
<br><br>

<<He>>【은는】 그 자리에서 얼어붙는다. "자-잠깐만, 파트너. 이게 다 무슨 소리야?"
<br><br>

"네가 괜찮다고 했잖아, 그래서 우리한테 좋을 것 같아서."
<br><br>

<<He>>【은는】 잠시 생각한다. "알았어." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "한번 해보지 뭐."
<br><br>

당신이 <<him>>【을를】 더 가까이 끌어당기려 하자,

<<if C.npc.Alex.gender is "f">>
	<<he>>【은는】 <<his>> 자세를 바꿔 당신의 무릎 위에 올라탄다.

<<else>>
	<<he>>【은는】 당신을 <<his>> 무릎 위로 끌어당긴다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"왜 그렇게 시무룩해?" <<he>>【이가】 씨익 웃으며 말한다. "이제 나한테 제대로 한 번 태워줘야지. <<if C.npc.Alex.gender is "f">>나를 임신시키고<<else>>내가 너를 임신시키길<</if>> 원하지 않았어?" 알렉스가 더 가까이 다가와 <<his>> 눈을 감으며 말한다.
<br><br>

